      "id": 490011,
      "username": "Abdeali",
      "name": "Abdeali Chharchhodawala",
      "created_at": "2026-01-02T05:50:21.564Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/3/73638e6efbb24958a57cdb8bdf527379eda89777.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/73638e6efbb24958a57cdb8bdf527379eda89777\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/3/73638e6efbb24958a57cdb8bdf527379eda89777_2_690x276.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gsMcSgbbaXVniJltd9WtVDcArLF\" width=\"690\" height=\"276\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/3/73638e6efbb24958a57cdb8bdf527379eda89777_2_690x276.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/3/73638e6efbb24958a57cdb8bdf527379eda89777_2_1035x414.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/3/73638e6efbb24958a57cdb8bdf527379eda89777_2_1380x552.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1D1E1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1796×721 50.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>You will get this objects in report template:</strong></p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"javascript\"><code class=\"lang-javascript\">    \t\tconst content = frappe.render_template(template, {\n\t\t\ttitle: __(this.report_name),\n\t\t\tsubtitle: print_settings?.include_filters ? filters_html : null,\n\t\t\tfilters: applied_filters,\n\t\t\tdata: data,\n\t\t\toriginal_data: this.data,\n\t\t\tcolumns: columns,\n\t\t\treport: this,\n\t\t});\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>Reference:</strong></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubblob\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/report/financial_statements.html\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/report/financial_statements.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com/frappe/erpnext</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <h4><a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/report/financial_statements.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">erpnext/accounts/report/financial_statements.html</a></h4>\n\n<div class=\"git-blob-info\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/report/financial_statements.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><code>develop</code></a>\n</div>\n\n\n      <pre><code class=\"lang-html\">{%\n\tvar report_columns = report.get_columns_for_print();\n\treport_columns = report_columns.filter(col =&gt; !col.hidden);\n\n\tif (report_columns.length &gt; 8) {\n\t\tfrappe.throw(__(\"Too many columns. Export the report and print it using a spreadsheet application.\"));\n\t}\n%}\n\n&lt;style&gt;\n\t.financial-statements-important td {\n\t\tfont-weight: bold;\n\t}\n\n\t.financial-statements-blank-row td {\n\t\theight: 37px;\n\t}\n&lt;/style&gt;\n\n&lt;h2 class=\"text-center\"&gt;{%= __(report.report_name) %}&lt;/h2&gt;\n</code></pre>\n\n\n\n  This file has been truncated. <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/report/financial_statements.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">show original</a>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><strong>When Printing/PDF a report:</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1b4b5d5a9b597ed690f89b98c8144fef93becf92.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1b4b5d5a9b597ed690f89b98c8144fef93becf92\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1b4b5d5a9b597ed690f89b98c8144fef93becf92_2_690x437.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3TsmiSpttuEjpUVkczTRCB6rnq2\" width=\"690\" height=\"437\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1b4b5d5a9b597ed690f89b98c8144fef93becf92_2_690x437.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1b4b5d5a9b597ed690f89b98c8144fef93becf92.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1b4b5d5a9b597ed690f89b98c8144fef93becf92.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1F211F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">890×564 37.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>Default Frappe Template:</strong></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubblob\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/blob/develop/frappe/public/js/frappe/views/reports/print_grid.html\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/blob/develop/frappe/public/js/frappe/views/reports/print_grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com/frappe/frappe</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <h4><a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/blob/develop/frappe/public/js/frappe/views/reports/print_grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">frappe/public/js/frappe/views/reports/print_grid.html</a></h4>\n\n<div class=\"git-blob-info\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/blob/develop/frappe/public/js/frappe/views/reports/print_grid.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><code>develop</code></a>\n</div>\n\n\n      <pre><code class=\"lang-html\">&lt;!-- title --&gt;\n{% if title %}\n&lt;h2&gt;{{ __(title) }}&lt;/h2&gt;\n&lt;hr&gt;\n{% endif %}\n{% if subtitle %}\n\t{{ subtitle }}\n\t&lt;hr&gt;\n{% endif %}\n&lt;table class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;\n\t&lt;!-- heading --&gt;\n\t&lt;thead&gt;\n\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n\t\t&lt;th&gt; # &lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t{% for col in columns %}\n\t\t\t{% if col.name &amp;&amp; col._id !== \"_check\" %}\n\t\t\t&lt;th\n\t\t\t\t{% if col.minWidth %}\n\t\t\t\t\tstyle=\"min-width: {{ col.minWidth }}px\"\n\t\t\t\t{% endif %}\n</code></pre>\n\n\n\n  This file has been truncated. <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/blob/develop/frappe/public/js/frappe/views/reports/print_grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">show original</a>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
